msgstr "已有账号？"

msgid "A full-fledged open source solution for data labeling"
msgstr "功能完备的开源数据标注解决方案"

msgid "Brought to you by"
msgstr "由以下团队提供"

msgid "Did you know?"
msgstr "你知道吗？"

msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "了解更多"

msgid "See all templates"
msgstr "查看全部模板"

msgid ""
"You can sync data from all popular cloud storage providers to collect new "
"items for labeling as they are uploaded, and return the annotation results "
"to train and continuously improve models."
msgstr "你可以连接各大云存储服务商，自动同步新上传的数据用于标注，并将标注结果回流用于模型训练与持续优化。"

msgid ""
"There's an Enterprise version of Label Studio packed with more features and "
"automation to label data faster while ensuring the highest quality."
msgstr "Label Studio 提供功能更丰富的企业版，借助更多自动化能力在保证最高质量的同时更快完成数据标注。"

msgid ""
"Label Studio has dozens of pre-built templates for all data types you can "
"use to configure your labeling UI, from image classification to sentiment "
"analysis to supervised LLM fine-tuning."
msgstr "Label Studio 内置数十种覆盖各类数据类型的预制模板，可用于快速配置标注界面——从图像分类、情感分析到大模型监督微调。"

msgid ""
"Label Studio now has a Starter Cloud offering optimized for small teams and "
"projects."
msgstr "Label Studio 现已推出面向小团队和小型项目的 Starter Cloud 版本。"

